分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,36.6 9.1,43.8 14.2,47.2 19.3,61.4 24.5,71.3 29.6,68.3 34.7,57.0 39.8,58.2 44.9,59.5 50.0,67.7 55.1,71.4 60.3,74.6 65.4,74.7 70.5,69.6 75.6,74.4 80.7,78.9 85.8,79.3 91.0,78.5 96.1,80.1 101.2,79.7 106.3,71.6 111.4,67.9 116.5,62.9 121.6,52.6 126.8,61.9 131.9,71.7 137.0,69.7 142.1,72.4 147.2,68.8 152.3,74.6 157.4,69.5 162.6,83.4 167.7,84.6 172.8,85.1 177.9,92.6 183.0,81.4 188.1,87.1 193.2,80.7 198.4,85.8 203.5,95.7 208.6,97.2 213.7,95.3 218.8,90.1 223.9,75.0 229.0,77.0 234.2,70.6 239.3,69.8 244.4,43.5 249.5,61.2 254.6,53.5 259.7,54.4 264.9,47.8 270.0,29.9 275.1,26.0 280.2,27.6 285.3,15.7 290.4,19.9 295.5,15.3 300.7,21.3 305.8,14.9 310.9,12.8 316.0,13.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"13.2\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,68.1 6.1,66.8 8.3,68.0 10.4,71.8 12.5,78.1 14.7,77.7 16.8,78.9 19.0,82.6 21.1,87.4 23.2,89.0 25.4,87.4 27.5,78.4 29.6,80.0 31.8,78.6 33.9,79.0 36.1,78.4 38.2,97.2 40.3,91.7 42.5,92.0 44.6,95.6 46.7,90.6 48.9,91.6 51.0,88.6 53.2,86.1 55.3,87.5 57.4,85.5 59.6,82.5 61.7,77.4 63.8,73.2 66.0,76.4 68.1,76.2 70.2,70.6 72.4,68.0 7